    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying no",
     "texto": [
      "**Нет** is «no» as an answer. To negate a word, you put **не** in front of it: **Я не врач** (I am not a doctor).",
      "Yes-or-no questions only change the intonation: **Вы студент?** = are you a student? (formal)"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
